WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.600
Claude asks two questions

00:00:02.600 --> 00:00:06.600
On the question, press RET to open it in a buffer of its own

00:00:06.600 --> 00:00:10.600
Press 1 to choose the csv module for the first question

00:00:10.600 --> 00:00:16.500
Press 1 and 2 to toggle double and single quotes for the second

00:00:16.500 --> 00:00:20.000
C-c C-c sends the answers, and the turn finishes
